      "exactness": "The accepted phase is after coap_insert_node and timer update, with the successful-send, CON, unreliable-transport and allocation guards satisfied. Binding only node->timeout assignment is incomplete."
    },
    {
      "id": "BIND-DEADLINE",
      "property_role": "response_and_clock",
